  "body": "Should `fetch()` set `user-agent` by default? Allow appending bytes? Allow replacing it? Allow it to be omitted?\n\nSee https://github.com/slightlyoff/ServiceWorker/issues/348#issuecomment-48568988 for context.\n\nAnd why is it on the forbidden header list? It has been since forever, but is there strong rationale?\n",
